"open":{"tax":"Confirmed line 3 ('Seconda casa / non resident 9 %') is not supported by its pages: the AdE guide gives prima casa to a buyer resident elsewhere who moves residence to the comune within 18 months, and never says non-residents pay 9 %. The worklist line stays open.","rental":"Confirmed lines 9 (CIN header: its only URL is saved as a stub page, and the FAQ it cites is not in its URLs), 10 (L. 213/2023 c. 63 not on either page) and 14 (Firenze: TAR 1028/2026 and 1752/2026, the Ex Bufalini appeal, the keybox ban and the 28 sqm rule are on neither page) are rejected, so their worklist lines stay open."}}
